      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "NUM",
          "chapter": 21,
          "verse": 9
        }
      ],
      "en": "Moses made a serpent of bronze, and set it on the pole. If a serpent had bitten any man, when he looked at the serpent of bronze, he lived.",
      "ko": "모세가 놋뱀을 만들어 장대 위에 다니 뱀에게 물린 자마다 놋뱀을 쳐다본즉 살더라",
      "source_text_hash": "e06d55f88a9e0d43acb96799183dc94531378a93a69a3a06f02e839337f3b7f6",
      "translation_text_hash": "b8e434c5ebfa64ff6a604c38a88dc14c6c01bf7e53ca44a3d04e23db97ff0a0d",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "모세가 놋뱀을 만들어 장대 위에 다니 뱀에게 물린 자마다 놋뱀을 쳐다본즉 살더라"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "b8e434c5ebfa64ff6a604c38a88dc14c6c01bf7e53ca44a3d04e23db97ff0a0d"
      ]
