      "en": "The children of Israel traveled, and encamped in Oboth.",
      "ko": "이스라엘 자손이 진행하여 오봇에 진 쳤고",
      "source_text_hash": "a6885d59a0d833b875625d2f63ce801c1b5af1b3945998a1bf7b8f3eae4d9e43",
      "translation_text_hash": "8851f115156f8a3ba456ac127202c30b0f56812efbbf61a89a5460474011ac97",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "이스라엘 자손이 진행하여 오봇에 진 쳤고"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "8851f115156f8a3ba456ac127202c30b0f56812efbbf61a89a5460474011ac97"
      ]
    },
    {
