      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "NUM",
          "chapter": 21,
          "verse": 12
        }
      ],
      "en": "From there they traveled, and encamped in the valley of Zered.",
      "ko": "거기서 진행하여 세렛 골짜기에 진 쳤고",
      "source_text_hash": "e1dd86973185e6c0164dbce2d09e911cf406ac417571a7f0725c631874436ff0",
      "translation_text_hash": "05603bd40f65843f0020c05eaa4d9cf5e6571529157ab27436755852e94bb4d0",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
